OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fwith lengthy clear spells across north
OL,7,Fand mid-Wales this evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, with a fairly widespread
OL,9,Ffrost. Some isolated freezing fog
OL,10,Fpatches are likely in places. Cloudier
OL,11,Fand breezy in the far south with some
OL,12,Fpatchy light rain.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FCold and cloudy in the morning
OL,15,Fwith light patches of rain for central
OL,16,Fareas. During the evening it will
OL,17,Fbecome breezy, and further rain will
OL,18,Farrive in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
